{
  "slug": "claude-code-hermit",
  "name": "Claude Code Hermit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Persistent autonomous assistant with session discipline, crash recovery, learning loop, daily rhythm, and phone control via channels & remote control. Runs always-on in Docker — one plugin, unlimited personal assistants.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **27 skills**, **4 agents** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (27): `brief` (Returns a 5-line executive summary of recent work), `channel-responder` (Handles inbound messages from Claude Code Channels (Telegram, Discord, webhooks) with session context awareness), `channel-setup` (Guided channel activation for local/tmux users — installs the plugin, configures the bot token in the project-local state…), `cortex-refresh` (Regenerate obsidian/Connections.md and obsidian/Cortex Portal.md from current hermit state), `cortex-sync` (Enrich existing hermit content with frontmatter and tags), `docker-setup` (Generates Docker scaffolding and walks the operator through the full deployment — token setup, build, start, MCP plugin…), `hatch` (Initializes the autonomous agent in the current project), `heartbeat` (Executes the heartbeat checklist from HEARTBEAT.md), and 19 more\n- **Agents** (4): `hermit-config-validator` (Lightweight .claude-code-hermit/config.json validator — checks required keys, types, routine times, channel structure, env naming), `proposal-triage` (Pre-creation gate for proposals — deduplicates against existing PROP-NNN files and applies the three-condition rule), `reflection-judge` (Post-processes reflect candidates — validates that cross-session evidence citations actually exist in S-NNN-REPORT.md before proposals or micro-approvals are…), `session-mgr` (Manages the session lifecycle — creates SHELL.md, tracks progress, handles closeout, and archives session reports)\n- **Hooks** (4): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `SessionStart`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-code-hermit@claude-community` from `gtapps/claude-code-hermit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 27,
    "agent": 4,
    "hook": 4
  },
